### Health check
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/health

### Create student
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "student_no": "20260001",
  "name": "Zhang San",
  "class_id": 1,
  "phone": "13800000000",
  "email": "zhangsan@example.com",
  "address": "Dormitory A-101"
}

### Query student by number
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/students/by-no/20260001

### Search students
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/students?name=Zhang&class_name=Computer&major_name=Science&grade_year=2024&page=1&page_size=20

### Update student
PUT http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Zhang San Updated",
  "class_id": 2,
  "phone": "13900000000",
  "email": "zhangsan_updated@example.com",
  "address": "Dormitory B-202",
  "status": 1
}

### Soft delete student
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/students/1

### Query inactive students
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/v1/students?status=0
